[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0010","text":"…………哈，哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0020","text":"明明刚才才学过的……\n雏菜同学，却已经会了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0030","text":"——“福丸小糸小姐”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0050","text":"咦～\n小糸你在练习吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0060","text":"啊，嗯……！\n今天学的内容，稍微复习一下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0070","text":"是吗～？　小糸你\n今天练的内容，明明已经会了呀"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0080","text":"诶……\n是、是吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0090","text":"但是\n雏菜同学比我──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0100","text":"嗯～\n嘛，今天透前辈她们也不在，去上补习课了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0110","text":"雏菜和小糸你\n进度稍微快一点嘛～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0120","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0130","text":"不过大家都还没来～\n补习课还没结束吗～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0140","text":"啊……那个，约、约定的时间\n还有一会儿……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0150","text":"啊，对了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0160","text":"呐，小糸你\n组合live想做什么～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0170","text":"诶……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0180","text":"……浅仓呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0190","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0200","text":"组合live想做的事\n大概今天又要被问了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_03_0201","text":"Motion"}]
